	quest.300C12C908709304.quest_desc: [
		"Listen good friend..."
		""
		"I was never...."
		"There might..."
		"There might be never a US...."
		""
		"it...   was.... alllwaaaysss ...  just... me."
		"there is onely ME, there was never a \"US\"."
		""
		""
		"I used you for my OWN DESIRE..."
		"I used you for my OWN Plants..."
		"We where NEVER destened to work together!!!"
		""
		"And you falen right into my trap."
		"I MADE YOU!!! I created you!"
		"And you've beleaved me all this time..."
		""
		"You should be ashamed ouf yourself. You can't even stand correclty in this world you beleaved was your own home. Despite being abel to turn around for you for even just a tiny bit!"
		""
		"Now look at you, your weight of dispariy. Does it feel forefilled? Does it feel compleated???"
		""
		"You just think this is a blocky game; BUT ITS A BLOCKY GAME WHERE I LIVE IN !! You can't kill me... And you never will... And do you know why?? BECAUSE YOU NEED ME...."
		""
		""
		""
		"There could be anything behind that last mission. And you will always go do it. Because why? Because you are adivted to my Cafe. And you can't ever do anything against that."
		""
		""
		""
		"But you know what? If you chestmark this last Quest, a Secret Questline activates that delets this ENTIRY WORLD. "
		""
		"And you really whant to loose all your progres are you? "
		"Its your OWN CHOISE."
		""
		"But at the End you will click it anyway."
		""
		""
		""
		"at the end i always win"
	]
