	quest.7DC6132F76AAA509.quest_desc: [
		"Your journey should begin at 1000001 225 9999996 in your Spaceship."
		""
		""
		""
		""
		"You are currently on a Mission. Specifically at Coordinate 1000001 225 9999996 in the Expansionrim of the Federation."
		""
		"Your Goal is to carecully Negotiate a Allians between Planet Earth and our Empire."
		""
		"For this Mission we brought you a BB2 assistens. It is a bit fragile so don't judge him too hard. It was suited with a advanced AI Cloud that can acces your Neuro Chip for further Instructions."
		""
		"Please remember to not drink too much coffee. We still don't know how your Neuro Chip will react to it."
		""
		""
		""
		"You currently flying closer to your destination. You see that some errors occured in the Navigating Sythem. Thankfully your BB2 assistend is already fixing it in the machine room."
		""
		""
		"You want to go help. You first equip your Space Suit by pressing the Gold Button at the back."
		"You then refill the Cheast Piece with fresh Oxygen."
		"After that you enable the Autopilot by pressing the Blackstone Button at the Front Controller."
	]
